  partName: Gasket (2)
  description: The Gasket (2) is a tiny, thin-flat metal component positioned at
    the middle-center-front of the engine, serving as a seal between two adjacent
    parts to prevent fluid or gas leaks. Made of mid-tone metal, this gasket plays
    a vital role in maintaining the engine's overall efficiency and reliability.
    Notably, its small size belies its importance, as even a minor leak can lead
    to significant performance degradation.
